{"id":"n49468-1-7","stage":5,"title":"당뇨병 · 糖尿病","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49468-1-7-1","ko":"환자분, 혹시 다른 질병이 있습니까?","zh":"患者，您还有其他疾病吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"환자분,","meaning":"患者，病人；位","explanation":"환자：患者，病人；분：位","readings":[{"term":"환자","audio":"/audio/7780fb9b6e0ea5fdf5fa.mp3"},{"term":"분","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31669","senseId":"1","lemma":"환자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"27780","senseId":"1","lemma":"분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"환자분","audio":"/audio/b67c1dee24532e77b60d.mp3"}},{"text":"혹시","meaning":"是不是，是否","explanation":"혹시：是不是，是否","readings":[{"term":"혹시","audio":"/audio/c99406fc3132c80df65d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87955","senseId":"4","lemma":"혹시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"혹시","audio":"/audio/c99406fc3132c80df65d.mp3"}},{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}},{"text":"질병이","meaning":"疾病","explanation":"질병：疾病；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"질병","audio":"/audio/a0fb3b92c46efc588e36.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29015","senseId":"1","lemma":"질병","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"질병이","audio":"/audio/1ffb146366f7d1cd3c85.mp3"}},{"text":"있습니까?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；습니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있습니까","audio":"/audio/82a1efff276ac41f1dca.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7780fb9b6e0ea5fd","term":"환자","zh":"患者，病人","audio":"/audio/7780fb9b6e0ea5fdf5fa.mp3","entryI