":"调节，调整","explanation":"조절：调节，调整","readings":[{"term":"조절","audio":"/audio/bdb0be04d6df4640a008.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24596","senseId":"1","lemma":"조절","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조절","audio":"/audio/bdb0be04d6df4640a008.mp3"}},{"text":"약을","meaning":"药","explanation":"약：药；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"약","audio":"/audio/2a9db5dfd1480367dc36.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72379","senseId":"1","lemma":"약","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"약을","audio":"/audio/f745a64b3ad605aada03.mp3"}},{"text":"먹고","meaning":"服，吃","explanation":"먹다：服，吃；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"3","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹고","audio":"/audio/b2dca7d94e3e3049878e.mp3"}},{"text":"있어요.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어요","audio":"/audio/499f8423f214354759ff.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"1bff5fd6471055d6","term":"당뇨병","zh":"糖尿病","audio":"/audio/1bff5fd6471055d6d092.mp3","entryId":"49468","definition":"排出的尿液不正常，里面掺杂很多糖分的疾病。","pronunciation":["당뇨뼝"]},{"id":"aa7d5951523a5e0b","term":"혈당","zh":"血糖","audio":"/audio/aa7d5951523a5e0bee05.mp3","entryId":"86907","definition":"血液中含有的糖分。","pronunciation":["혈땅"]},{"id":"bdb0be04d6df4640","term":"조절","zh":"调节，调整","audio":"/audio/bdb0be04d6df4640a008.mp3","entryId":"24596","definition":"进行纠正、调配而使之保持均衡或符合状况。","pronunciation":["조절"]},{"id":"2a9db5dfd1480367","term":"약","zh":"药","audio":"/audio/2a9db5dfd1480367dc36.mp3","entryId":"72379","definition":"为了治疗、预防病患或伤口，服用、抹、注射的物质。","pronunciation":["약"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"服，吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将药物放进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/6b5ef58c8ddcb904c37e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.318,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=49468","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":158,"sequenceScore":3.1447,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["患者，您还有其他疾病吗？","有的。我因为糖尿病，正在服用控制血糖的药。","你为什么一瘸一拐的？哪里受伤了吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["患者，您还有其他疾病吗？","有的。我因为糖尿病，正在服用控制血糖的药。","你为什么一瘸一拐的？哪里受伤了吗？"],"answer":1}]}
